        "_evidence.nobleRows180d / nobleUnits: how many rows this site filed against that target in the last 180 days and under which unit labels.",
        "unit is the Noble field's unit (the mapping target); _evidence.x6Unit is what the analyzer transmits. Where they differ (HCV/HIV/HAV AU/mL vs S/CO, TOXO/Rubella IgG IU/mL vs AU/mL, tTG IgA AU/mL vs U/ml) no numeric conversion is applied."
